  note          = {Early CFS muscle biopsy study (n=21 CFS, quadriceps). Found morphostructural alterations: sarcoplasmic fatty degeneration, fibrous regeneration, mitochondrial polymorphism/monstrosity, reduced mitochondrial enzyme activities, and mtDNA common deletion 150--3000$\times$ normal. Selective muscle hyperalgesia (P<0.001) with normal skin/subcutis thresholds. Earliest evidence of disrupted muscle regeneration + mitochondrial pathology in CFS.},
