  pmid          = {32296708},
  note          = {n=161 ME/CFS screened for anti-PDC and anti-mitochondrial antibodies. Only 1/161 positive for anti-PDC (vs 15/15 PBC controls). Anti-cardiolipin not elevated. IMPORTANT NULL: serum factor impairing mitochondrial function in ME/CFS is NOT an anti-mitochondrial autoantibody. Implies cytokines/metabolites/miRNA/exosomes as circulating mediator.},
