  pmid          = {36041422},
  note          = {Methodological platform paper from the IBEC/Barcelona group (Ram\'on-Azc\'on lab) that produced Mughal 2025. Establishes xeno-free human platelet lysate hydrogel (HUgel) for 3D muscle bioengineering. Human satellite stem cells form aligned myotubes with sarcomeric proteins; electrical stimulation + non-invasive force measurement. This is the foundational technology for the Mughal 2025 ME/CFS serum study.},
